---
import SiteHeader from '../SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../SiteFooter.astro';

const prefix = Astro.locals.marketConfig.urlPrefix;
---
<SiteHeader />

<main class="about">

  <!-- ══ HERO ══ -->
  <section class="ab-hero">
    <picture>
      <source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/home/m3.avif" />
      <img src="/home/d3.avif" alt="Mir Kash" />
    </picture>
    <div class="ab-hero__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ab-hero__overlay">
      <p class="ab-eyebrow ab-eyebrow--light">Our Story</p>
      <h1 class="ab-display ab-hero__line">A love letter to dreamers &amp; changemakers.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ FOUNDER'S LETTER ══ -->
  <section class="ab-letter">
    <div class="ab-letter__inner">
      <p class="ab-eyebrow ab-center-x">From the Founder</p>
      <p class="ab-display ab-letter__open">In a world always chasing the next new thing &mdash; faster, flashier, more &mdash; I longed to create something fundamentally different. A brand that values patience, purpose and personality as much as beauty. That&rsquo;s how Mir Kash began.</p>
      <div class="ab-letter__body">
        <p>Two years and countless sketches, samples and soulful conversations later, I&rsquo;m immensely grateful for the community that has grown around Mir Kash. We&rsquo;re a small but passionate group who care deeply about quality, meaning and mindful living. We don&rsquo;t flood the world with endless products &mdash; instead, we obsess over the details and perfect a few pieces each year, because I truly believe the simplest things are the hardest to get just right.</p>
        <p>From day one, Mir Kash has been self-funded and independent. This freedom lets us move at our own rhythm and stay true to our values, ensuring every decision echoes our commitment to sustainability and integrity. My hope has always been to create pieces for those who genuinely connect with our story &mdash; pieces that add something thoughtful to your life, and that positively impact every pair of hands, from our craftspeople to you.</p>
        <p>Mir Kash is my love letter to dreamers and changemakers. We exist to advocate for an inclusive, responsible and inspiring future &mdash; empowering like-minded souls to choose what truly matters. I hope our designs spark joy and offer beauty you can feel proud to carry.</p>
        <p>Thank you, from the bottom of my heart, for joining us and believing in Mir Kash. If you ever want to chat, my inbox is always open &mdash; I love hearing your stories.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="ab-sig-pre">With gratitude,</p>
      <p class="ab-display ab-sig">Rajul Daga</p>
      <p class="ab-sig-role">Founder, Mir Kash</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ FULL-BLEED BREAK ══ -->
  <section class="ab-full">
    <picture>
      <source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/home/m4.avif" />
      <img src="/home/d4.avif" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    </picture>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ OUR ETHICS (warm cream) ══ -->
  <section class="ab-cream">
    <div class="ab-editorial">
      <p class="ab-eyebrow">Our Ethics</p>
      <h2 class="ab-display ab-h2">We will never use <em>animal leather.</em></h2>
      <p class="ab-body ab-body--wide">At Mir Kash, style should never come at the cost of animals or the planet. Our timeless, luxury bags are crafted from sustainable, cruelty-free materials like apple, cactus and microfibre leathers &mdash; made in small batches with meticulous attention to detail, full transparency and minimal environmental impact. Every bag lets you carry your style with pride and conscience.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ OUR MATERIALS (image + text) ══ -->
  <section class="ab-split">
    <div class="ab-split__img">
      <picture>
        <source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/home/m6.avif" />
        <img src="/home/d6.avif" alt="Mir Kash apple-leather bag" loading="lazy" />
      </picture>
    </div>
    <div class="ab-split__text">
      <p class="ab-eyebrow">Our Materials</p>
      <h2 class="ab-display ab-h2">Not leather. <em>Better.</em></h2>
      <p class="ab-body">We craft luxury vegan bags using revolutionary plant-based leathers made from apple peels, cactus leaves and recycled fibres &mdash; waterproof, durable and ultra-luxe materials that outshine traditional leather without harming the planet. We innovate with microfibre suede for a rich finish, and are actively pioneering new materials like mushroom and banana-peel leather.</p>
      <a class="ab-link" href={`${prefix}/pages/materials`}>Explore our materials &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ CREDENTIALS ══ -->
  <section class="ab-vows">
    <div class="ab-vow"><span class="ab-display ab-vow__n">Cruelty-free</span><p>Every bag, lining and detail. Nothing from an animal, ever.</p></div>
    <div class="ab-vow"><span class="ab-display ab-vow__n">Small batch</span><p>A few pieces, perfected each year. Never rushed.</p></div>
    <div class="ab-vow"><span class="ab-display ab-vow__n">Independent</span><p>Self-funded from day one, so our values lead every decision.</p></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ PULL-QUOTE BAND ══ -->
  <section class="ab-quote">
    <p class="ab-display ab-quote__line">The simplest things are the hardest to get <em>just right.</em></p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ CLOSING CTA ══ -->
  <section class="ab-cta">
    <p class="ab-display ab-cta__line">Beauty you can feel proud to carry.</p>
    <div class="ab-cta__links">
      <a href={`${prefix}/shop`}>Explore the collection &rarr;</a>
      <a href={`${prefix}/pages/materials`}>Our materials &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<SiteFooter />

<style is:global>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;500&display=swap');

  :root { --cherry: #8B1A1A; --depth: #2C1A0E; }
  body { background: #fff; }
  .hdr-menu-btn { display: none; }
  .site-header--minimal .logo { grid-column: 2; justify-self: center; }
  .site-header--minimal .logo img { height: 22px; }
  .site-header--minimal .hdr-right { grid-column: 3; justify-self: end; gap: 14px; }

  .about {
    --serif-display: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    --cream: #F6F1E9;
    --oat: #EBE1D2;
    --body-ink: #4a4038;
    background: #fff; color: var(--depth);
  }
  /* Elegant serif for every display line; em = cherry accent (never italic) */
  .ab-display { font-family: var(--serif-display); font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .about em { font-style: normal; color: var(--cherry); }

  .ab-eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500; color: var(--cherry); margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .ab-eyebrow--light { color: #fff; opacity: .9; }
  .ab-center-x { text-align: center; }
  .ab-body { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--body-ink); margin: 0; }
  .ab-body--wide { max-width: 60ch; }

  /* ── Hero ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-hero { position: relative; width: 100%; height: clamp(460px, 82vh, 820px); overflow: hidden; }
  .ab-hero picture, .ab-hero img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .ab-hero__scrim {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.12) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,.02) 42%, rgba(0,0,0,.5) 100%);
  }
  .ab-hero__overlay {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 2;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end;
    text-align: center; padding: 0 var(--gutter) clamp(52px, 9vh, 104px);
  }
  .ab-hero__line {
    color: #fff; font-size: clamp(34px, 5.4vw, 76px); line-height: 1.08;
    max-width: 16ch; margin: 0;
  }
  .ab-hero__line em { color: #fff; opacity: .85; }

  /* ── Founder's letter ───────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-letter { padding: clamp(72px, 12vw, 150px) var(--gutter); }
  .ab-letter__inner { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .ab-letter__open {
    text-align: center; color: var(--depth);
    font-size: clamp(25px, 3.4vw, 40px); line-height: 1.34;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px);
  }
  .ab-letter__body p { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.95; color: var(--body-ink); margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .ab-sig-pre { font-size: 15px; color: var(--body-ink); margin: 34px 0 6px; }
  .ab-sig { font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px); color: var(--depth); margin: 0; line-height: 1; }
  .ab-sig-role {
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #a8a39c; margin: 12px 0 0;
  }

  /* ── Full-bleed break ───────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-full { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 6.5; overflow: hidden; background: var(--cream); }
  .ab-full img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }

  /* ── Section headline ───────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-h2 { color: var(--depth); font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 56px); line-height: 1.06; margin: 0 0 24px; }

  /* ── Ethics (cream, centered) ───────────────────────── */
  .ab-cream { background: var(--cream); padding: clamp(80px, 13vw, 168px) var(--gutter); }
  .ab-editorial { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .ab-editorial .ab-body--wide { margin: 0 auto; }

  /* ── Materials (image + text split) ─────────────────── */
  .ab-split {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 88px); max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(80px, 12vw, 160px) var(--gutter);
  }
  .ab-split__img { aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; overflow: hidden; background: var(--cream); }
  .ab-split__img img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .ab-split__text { max-width: 34rem; }
  .ab-link {
    display: inline-block; margin-top: 26px;
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600; color: var(--depth); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--depth);
    padding-bottom: 3px; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s, border-color .2s;
  }
  .ab-link:hover { color: var(--cherry); border-color: var(--cherry); }

  /* ── Credentials ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-vows {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 64px);
    max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(72px, 11vw, 128px) var(--gutter);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule, #e4dfd7); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule, #e4dfd7);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ab-vow__n { display: block; color: var(--depth); font-size: 30px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .ab-vow p { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--body-ink); margin: 0 auto; max-width: 24ch; }

  /* ── Pull-quote band (oat) ──────────────────────────── */
  .ab-quote { background: var(--oat); text-align: center; padding: clamp(88px, 15vw, 200px) var(--gutter); }
  .ab-quote__line { color: var(--depth); font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px); line-height: 1.18; max-width: 16ch; margin: 0 auto; }

  /* ── Closing CTA ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-cta { text-align: center; padding: clamp(80px, 12vw, 150px) var(--gutter); }
  .ab-cta__line { color: var(--depth); font-size: clamp(28px, 3.8vw, 46px); line-height: 1.1; margin: 0 0 30px; }
  .ab-cta__links { display: inline-flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 16px 44px; }
  .ab-cta__links a {
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600; color: var(--depth); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--depth);
    padding-bottom: 3px; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s, border-color .2s;
  }
  .ab-cta__links a:hover { color: var(--cherry); border-color: var(--cherry); }

  /* ── Mobile ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ab-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .ab-split__text { max-width: none; }
    .ab-vows { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .ab-full { aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; }
    .ab-letter__body p { font-size: 15px; }
  }
</style>
